              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kokut emalaika lokiwuniet akerupepe, kibirun aacerit nakapolon kotoma akuj, enoki kwape akalas, kibirokin atutubet nakiwuniet naka icorin, ka atanin da nuka akipi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.8.10",
